[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0010","text":"好像快要开始拍摄了\n……流程都记住了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0020","text":"……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0030","text":"OK！\n那么，准备好回到童年了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0040","text":"那是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0050","text":"凛世……还没有……\n需要回去的……大人程度……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0060","text":"啊，啊啊……\n抱歉，说得也是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0070","text":"凛世……\n无需回去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0080","text":"因为……\n此刻……很开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0090","text":"────拍摄开始！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_03_0100","text":"嗯……"}]
